291	    /**
292	     * The ceiling on this owner's {@link #getMembershipLevel() membership level}, stamped
293	     * when the owner is created as one above the highest membership level then held by an
294	     * existing member of its household, or null when the owner had no existing household
295	     * member and so is subject to no ceiling. See {@link #getMembershipLevel()}.
